<#f0f000>Movelist :</>

<#f0f000>Basics:</>

Forwards Hop					_F_F
Back Hop				_B_B
Forwards Air Dash				_F_F
Backwards Air Dash				_B_B

Light Kick				^A
Strong Kick				^B
Desk Slam				^C

Low Punch				^A (crouch)
Low Slide				^B (crouch)
Chair Upper					^C (crouch)
(Knocks Down)

Air Punch				^A (air)
Air Kick				^B (air)
Air Desk Throw				^C (air)

Throw					^X

<#f0f000>Unique Moves:</>

Dashing Elbow				_F+^B
(Has Grab Invincibility)

<#f0f000>Special Attacks:</>

Uppercut				_D_DF_F^A
(Iframes on Startup, can be Jump-Cancelled on hit)

Deer Rush				_D_DF_F^B
(Iframes on Startup, can be Jump-Cancelled on both hits)

Chair Throw				_D_DF_F^C

Bat				_D_DB_B^A / _D_DB_B^B / _D_DB_B^C
^A Counters standing and crouching physical attacks
^B Counters Projectiles
^C Jumps forward before swinging

Taniguchi Summon				_D_D^A
(Taniguchi slams a door onto the opponents face, after
getting surprised he runs back and slams it again)

Kunikida Summon				_D_D^B
(Kunikida walks forwards a bit before throwing 3 books)

<#f0f000>Super Attacks:</>

Guard Cancel (1 Bar)				_D_DB_B^A / _D_DB_B^B
^A Physical Bat Swing
^B Shoots Projectiles

Gun Blast (1 Bar)				_B_DB_D_DF_F^A
(A weak shot that removes all meter from the opponent)

Chair Barrage (1.5 Bars)				_B_DB_D_DF_F^B
(Iframes on startup, grants combos after the move ends)

Shamisen (1.5 Bars)				_D_D^C
(Kyon does a low slide before doing an unblockable elbow.
If succesful Kyon will throw Shamisen at the opponent)

Advanced Counter (1.5 Bars)				_D_DB_B^A+^B
(Kyon's counter but he can counter anything except grabs,
will have a normal attack and a projectile if succesful)

Rapid Fire (2 Bars)				B_DB_D_DF_F^C
(Kyon summons a ship to fire multiple projectiles)

Nagato Yuki Boost (At least 1 Bar)				D_DB_B^X
(Install that increases Kyon's damage output, timer is based
on Kyon's meter)

